The sentences in this folder, and the English translations linked to them, come from
Tatoeba (https://tatoeba.org) and are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 2.0
France (CC BY 2.0 FR): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/fr/

Each sentence and each translation is credited to the Tatoeba user who wrote it, in
`author` and `english[].by`. Where Tatoeba records no username, the field is null and the
credit is "Tatoeba contributors". A sentence's page is https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/<id>.

The `jyutping` field is not part of Tatoeba. It is covered by this repository's license,
CC BY-SA 4.0 (see ../README.md).
